<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>局域网 Laser Pen</title>
  <style>
    html, body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: transparent; font: 15px system-ui, sans-serif; }
    body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: #17232e; }
    header { background: #f5f7fa; padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 26px; }
    p { margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    #qr-code { width: 210px; height: 210px; background: white; }
    #client-url { display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 10px 0; }
    button, select { font: inherit; padding: 6px 12px; }
    #cvs { display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 120px; flex: 1; background: transparent; }
    #status { color: #126047; }
    #sensorDetails { white-space: pre-wrap; font: 13px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    code { background: #e5eaf0; padding: 2px 5px; }
    @media(max-width: 650px) { header { flex-wrap: wrap; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <img id="qr-code" alt="手机连接二维码">
    <div>
      <h1>局域网 Laser Pen</h1>
      <p id="status">正在连接本机服务…</p>
      <label>电脑局域网 IP <select id="addresses" aria-label="电脑局域网 IP"></select></label>
      <a id="client-url"></a>
      <button id="copy">复制手机地址</button>
      <p>手机与电脑连接同一 Wi-Fi，先信任本机证书，再用系统浏览器扫码打开。</p>
      <p>Canva 叠加：双击桌面的“启动激光笔”，再切换到 Canva 全屏播放。<br>结束演示：双击“停止激光笔”；仅隐藏激光层：<code>Ctrl + Alt + Q</code>。选择副屏见本地操作文档。</p>
      <p>下方是激光预览。跨窗口透明置顶由 Windows 辅助窗口提供。</p>
      <details>
        <summary>手机传感器状态</summary>
        <p id="sensorSummary">等待手机连接并报告传感器状态。</p>
        <pre id="sensorDetails"></pre>
      </details>
    </div>
  </header>
  <canvas id="cvs"></canvas>
</body>
</html>
